    <item>
      <title>Chrome AI“杀疯了”：Google浏览器也要“变身”智能体，但OpenAI已在“磨刀霍霍”？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/chrome-aigoogleopenai-20250919011005834-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 19 Sep 2025 01:10:05 +0800</pubDate>
